      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "exploration"
      ],
      "text": "The construction worker spends 1 minute inspecting the layout of a room and attempts a DC 22 Architecture-lore check check. On a success, they learn the size and layout of all adjacent rooms on the same floor (or all rooms on the floor on a critical success). They can inspect each room only once per day."
