    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Demolishing Swing",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The construction worker makes a maul Strike against a creature. If it hits, the creature is pushed 10 feet. If the target is wearing metal armor, its armor also takes the damage, which bypasses 5 of the armor's Hardness."
    }
  ],
  "text": "A brilliant architect can contemplate wondrous structural marvels, but someone must pick up a hammer and make these dreams real. Construction workers are the backbone of any city's infrastructure.\n\n---\nSociety is built upon the backs of laborers."
